## Upstream notices (retained, not superseded)

This repository incorporates work from upstream MIT-licensed projects. Their
copyright notices are retained in the files below and continue to apply to the
paths listed. The notice above does not replace them.

| Scope | Upstream notice |
|---|---|
| `interactive/` (the whole subtree) | `interactive/LICENSE` — derived from `babamba2/superclaude-for-sap` |

This scope was twice narrowed to a file list (2026-08-22/23) and twice
restored when review found the list short. The re-authoring that followed
settled the question the other way: as of 2026-08-23 every borrowed file
outside `interactive/server/sap-assets/` (30 files, kept deliberately — they
install SAP-side objects) has been **re-authored under independent review, or
— for 27 pure reference-table files — verified unchanged** (their content is
factual data, kept byte-identical on purpose). What still matches the upstream
text across the whole subtree is roughly **2,200 scattered lines in ~130
files** of deliberately kept contract material — reference tables, output
templates, checklists, user-facing phrases. A file list cannot express that,
so the notice stays on the subtree and `interactive/LICENSE` records the
accounting.

Component-level attribution for the distributed plugin, including bundled
runtime dependencies, is in `interactive/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
